# Bone Splinters: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature" (CR 118.8, 601.2h) is owed whatever it
# targets, so an attempted cast with no creature of its own cannot pay and reverses; with
# Ornithopter out it can (the positive control), and "Destroy target creature" (CR 701.8) puts the Blade in Bot2's graveyard
# and the sacrificed Ornithopter in Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Ornithopter
Bone Splinters
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hired Blade
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Hired Blade.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bone Splinters.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Hired Blade)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Bot1.Hand = Bone Splinters; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
? Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Hired Blade
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Bone Splinters.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Hired Blade)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
